<i>when the ground quakes
or lava spews from the earth,</i>


01:32:31.440 --> 01:32:36.544
<i>it's the dragons, letting us
know they're still here,</i>


01:32:36.546 --> 01:32:39.482
<i>waiting for us to figure out
how to get along.</i>


01:32:46.989 --> 01:32:49.991
<i>Yes, the world believes
the dragons are gone,</i>


01:32:49.993 --> 01:32:52.693
<i>if they ever existed at all.</i>


01:32:52.695 --> 01:32:57.698
<i>But we Berkians,
we know otherwise.</i>


01:32:57.700 --> 01:33:00.867
<i>And we'll guard this secret
until the time comes</i>


01:33:00.869 --> 01:33:04.871
